                <div class="header-wrapper">
                  <h3 id="impeller">Impeller</h3>
                  <a class="heading-link" href="#impeller" aria-label="Link to 'Impeller' section">#</a>
                </div>
                <ul>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Document how to debug/profile OpenGL ES on macOS. by @chinmaygarde in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53671">53671</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Make storage sizes typed. by @chinmaygarde in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53700">53700</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Re-enable fast blur path for elliptical rrects by @flar in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53704">53704</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] add experimental canvas support to screenshotter. by @jonahwilliams in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53751">53751</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] implement clear color opt for experimental canvas. by @jonahwilliams in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53749">53749</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] fix incorrect padding/translation in drawVertices with texture coordinates. by @jonahwilliams in 
                    <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53746">53746</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Exploit dynamic state in OpenGL for fewer program links. by @chinmaygarde in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53764">53764</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Disable OpenGL dithering by default. by @chinmaygarde in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53768">53768</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] implement experimental canvas in snapshot controller. by @jonahwilliams in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53750">53750</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Enable framebuffer fetch tests disabled on OpenGL ES. by @chinmaygarde in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53766">53766</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Use downsample shader for blur instead of mip levels. by @jonahwilliams in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53760">53760</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Avoid using a private GTest macro to skip tests. by @chinmaygarde in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53782">53782</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Validation logs indicate where in code the validation error happened. by @chinmaygarde in 
                    <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53784">53784</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Update docs that specify how to select the Impeller backend. by @chinmaygarde in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53788">53788</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Validation errors in tests cause GTest failures. by @chinmaygarde in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53786">53786</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Fix markdown formatting for blocks with tips. by @chinmaygarde in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53789">53789</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] move more aiks tests to DL.  by @jonahwilliams in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53792">53792</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Enable fixed-rate compression support in Vulkan. by @chinmaygarde in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53292">53292</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [dart:ui] remove expensive index assertion in Vertices. by @jonahwilliams in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53558">53558</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Ensure full transform is applied to text contents by @jonahwilliams in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53819">53819</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] move Aiks path unittests to DL by @jonahwilliams in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53799">53799</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Cleanup stale TODOs and fixup the format of others. by @chinmaygarde in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53825">53825</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Move images to flutter/assets-for-api-docs by @jtmcdole in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53917">53917</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Use depth transform in framebuffer blend entities. by @bdero in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53951">53951</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Convert basic AIKS golden tests to use DisplayList by @flar in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53969">53969</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] re-enable AHB swapchain. by @jonahwilliams in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53978">53978</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] try disabling backpressure in AHB swapchain. by @jonahwilliams in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/54012">54012</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] detect max cull rect on bounds. by @jonahwilliams in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/54013">54013</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] enable ahb swapchain on emulators. by @jonahwilliams in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/54019">54019</a>
                  </li>
