                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Remove implicit calls to glGetError in opt modes. by @chinmaygarde in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/54016">54016</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] ensure fp rounding errors don't cause us to lose a row of pixels when computing text positions. by @jonahwilliams in 
                    <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/54015">54015</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Cleanly revert requiring backpressure for AHB swapchains. by @chinmaygarde in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/54027">54027</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Impeller] Implement OpenGL to Vulkan texture trampolining. by @chinmaygarde in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/53966">53966</a>
                  </li>
