                    added shell_unittests and ui_unittests to the testing menu by @gaaclarke in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/55711">55711</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Flutter GPU] Added support to set primitive type by @AthulJoseph27 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/55514">55514</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Refactor multi-file build parsing into a single <code>BuildPlan</code> class. by @matanlurey in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/55720">55720</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Update Dart to 3.6.0-334.3.beta by @zanderso in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/engine/pull/55826">55826</a>
                  </li>
                </ul>
